# Single-repo Java — layered call chain (controller → service → repo → audit)
ID="sr_java_call_chain"
NAME="java layered service — four-hop write path"
QUESTION="在这个 Java 服务里,从 VisitController.create 到审计落库,完整的调用链是什么?每一跳在哪个类哪个方法,容量检查发生在哪一跳?"
FIXTURE="eval/fixtures/java-layered-service"
EXPECT_PRIMARY_MATCHES_REGEX="VisitController\.?(create)?
VisitService\.?(schedule)?
VisitRepository\.?(insert)?
AuditLog\.?(record)?
(容量|capacity|max).*(schedule|VisitService)|(schedule|VisitService).*(容量|capacity|max)
(System\.out\.println|控制台|标准输出).*(不|未|only|not).*(落库|持久|数据库|durab|persist)|(不|未|only|not).*(落库|持久|数据库|durab|persist).*(System\.out\.println|控制台|标准输出)"
